<mxfile><diagram id="module-gated-flux" name="Page-1"><mxGraphModel dx="0" dy="0" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="717" pageHeight="233" math="1" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="11" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 9.7px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;gene tokens&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;\(h_g\) from the backbone, perturbed graph" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=8.3;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#666666;strokeWidth=0.8;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=3;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0.00" y="0.00" width="50.00" height="88.00" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="12" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 9.7px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;abundance head&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;\(E_g=\gamma_g E^0_g\,\cdot\)&lt;br&gt;\(\exp(r\tanh(w^{\top}h_g))\)&lt;br&gt;\(\gamma_g\) hard (1 present, 0 deleted), no learned gate" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=8.3;fillColor=#FFE6CC;strokeColor=#D79B00;strokeWidth=0.8;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=3;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="61.00" y="0.00" width="96.00" height="88.00" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="13" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 9.7px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;pool, exact&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;\(E\leftarrow \rho E\)&lt;br&gt;\(\rho=\min(1,\ p_{\mathrm{avail}}/P)\)&lt;br&gt;\(P=\textstyle\sum_g \mathrm{MW}_g E_g\)&lt;br&gt;the GECKO pool holds" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=8.3;fillColor=#FFE6CC;strokeColor=#D79B00;strokeWidth=0.8;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=3;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="168.00" y="0.00" width="92.00" height="88.00" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="14" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 9.7px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;unit abundance&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;\(E_u\): power mean over a complex's subunits, sum over isozymes" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=8.3;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;strokeWidth=0.8;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=3;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="271.00" y="0.00" width="62.00" height="88.00" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="15" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 9.7px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;box&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;\(|v_j|\le k_{\mathrm{cat},u}E_u\) times the scale, inside \([\ell_j,u_j]\) scaled by availability" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=8.3;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;strokeWidth=0.8;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=3;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="344.00" y="0.00" width="78.00" height="88.00" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="16" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 9.7px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;elastic growth LP&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;\(\max\ v_{\mathrm{growth}}-M\textstyle\sum_i s_i\)&lt;br&gt;s.t. \(Sv=0\), \(v_i\ge \ell_i-s_i\),&lt;br&gt;\(0\le s_i\le \ell_i\) on forced bounds, the box otherwise; \(M=1\); HiGHS in micromole units" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=8.3;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;strokeWidth=0.8;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=3;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="433.00" y="0.00" width="112.00" height="88.00" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="17" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 9.7px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;optimum&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;\(v^*\), \(z^*\)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=8.3;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;strokeWidth=0.8;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=3;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="556.00" y="0.00" width="40.00" height="88.00" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="18" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 9.7px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;readout&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;\(\ell=\mathrm{head}(z)+g\,(a\,z^*+b)\)&lt;br&gt;\(+\,w^{\top}\log(1+|v^*_{\mathcal{R}}|),\ w_0=0\)&lt;br&gt;\(\mathcal{R}\): all 4,131 reactions, or the 274 exchanges" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=8.3;fillColor=#F8CECC;strokeColor=#B85450;strokeWidth=1.8;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=3;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="607.00" y="0.00" width="110.00" height="88.00" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="19" value="" style="endArrow=blockThin;endFill=1;endSize=5;html=1;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=0.8;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=8.3;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" edge="1" parent="1" source="11" target="12"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="20" value="" style="endArrow=blockThin;endFill=1;endSize=5;html=1;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=0.8;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=8.3;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" edge="1" parent="1" source="12" target="13"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="21" value="" style="endArrow=blockThin;endFill=1;endSize=5;html=1;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=0.8;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=8.3;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" edge="1" parent="1" source="13" target="14"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="22" value="" style="endArrow=blockThin;endFill=1;endSize=5;html=1;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=0.8;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=8.3;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" edge="1" parent="1" source="14" target="15"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="23" value="" style="endArrow=blockThin;endFill=1;endSize=5;html=1;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=0.8;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=8.3;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" edge="1" parent="1" source="15" target="16"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="24" value="" style="endArrow=blockThin;endFill=1;endSize=5;html=1;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=0.8;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=8.3;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" edge="1" parent="1" source="16" target="17"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="25" value="" style="endArrow=blockThin;endFill=1;endSize=5;html=1;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=0.8;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=8.3;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" edge="1" parent="1" source="17" target="18"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="26" value="" style="endArrow=blockThin;endFill=1;endSize=5;html=1;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=0.8;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=8.3;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;dashed=1;dashPattern=4 3;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=1;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="16" target="12"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="489.00" y="114.00"/><mxPoint x="109.00" y="114.00"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="27" value="backward: \(\partial z^*/\partial u_j\) is the dual of the ceiling (envelope theorem), nonzero only where it binds, plus the dual of the elastic row on the ceilings that block maintenance; through \(E_g\) to the backbone" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=8.3;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="119.00" y="118.00" width="360.00" height="24.00" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="28" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 9.7px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;by construction&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;\(v^*\) enters the head detached: the argmax is piecewise constant in the bounds, so the head reads it as a fixed feature of the current solve and no gradient flows through it&lt;br&gt;the growth column keeps its gated affine and \(w_0=0\), so the cell is the round-18 gated cell at initialization&lt;br&gt;the head's weight norm is logged each epoch (ess_flux_head_w_norm); \(Sv=0\), the ceilings and the pool hold exactly at \(v^*\) as in round 18" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=8.3;fillColor=#E1D5E7;strokeColor=#9673A6;strokeWidth=0.8;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=3;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0.00" y="154.00" width="440.00" height="78.00" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="29" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 9.7px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;measured (rounds 11 and 18)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;round 11 measured the deletion's pFBA flux vector at 0.77 as an encoding against its growth ratio at 0.65, and the dual-overlap probe measured that the ceilings bind on the same six reactions for every genotype; this reads what the solve returns instead of what it can move" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=8.3;fillColor=#F5F5F5;strokeColor=#666666;strokeWidth=0.8;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=3;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="456.00" y="154.00" width="261.00" height="78.00" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>